<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PFC — Phuket Family Concierge</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bespoke, tailor-made travel experiences in Phuket for families and couples — designed by a mum of four who has called Phuket home for nine years.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@500;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --teal:#1B6B67;
    --teal-dark:#124D4A;
    --cream:#FDF8F0;
    --cream-alt:#F5EEDD;
    --sand:#C9BFA5;
    --coral:#E28E76;
    --plumeria:#F2A9B8;
    --ink:#0F4C81;
    --grey:#6E6E6E;
    --script: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
    --sans: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{font-family:var(--sans); color:var(--ink); background:var(--cream); line-height:1.65; overflow-x:hidden;}
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  a{text-decoration:none; color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}
  section{padding:90px 0;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-weight:600;}
  .script{font-family:var(--script); font-weight:700; color:var(--teal);}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--script); font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--teal); display:block; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-block; padding:15px 34px; border-radius:40px; font-weight:600;
    font-size:.95rem; letter-spacing:.03em; transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
    border:2px solid transparent; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--teal); color:#fff; box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(27,107,103,.25);}
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(27,107,103,.35);}
  .btn-outline{background:transparent; color:var(--teal); border-color:var(--teal);}
  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--teal); color:#fff;}
  .btn-light{background:#fff; color:var(--teal);}

  /* NAV */
  header{position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(253,248,240,.92); backdrop-filter:blur(6px); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,191,165,.5);}
  nav{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 24px; max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto;}
  .brand{display:flex; flex-direction:column; line-height:1;}
  .brand .pfc{font-family:var(--script); font-size:1.9rem; color:var(--teal); font-weight:700;}
  .brand .sub{font-size:.55rem; letter-spacing:.22em; color:var(--grey); font-weight:600;}
  .brand img{height:54px; width:auto; display:block;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:34px; align-items:center; font-size:.9rem; font-weight:500;}
  .nav-links a{color:var(--ink); opacity:.8; transition:opacity .15s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{opacity:1; color:var(--teal);}
  .nav-links a.btn-primary{color:#fff; opacity:1;}
  .nav-links a.btn-primary:hover{color:#fff;}
  .nav-toggle{display:none; background:none; border:none; font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--teal); cursor:pointer;}

  @media(max-width:820px){
    .nav-links{position:fixed; top:64px; left:0; right:0; background:var(--cream); flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start;
      padding:18px 24px 26px; gap:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--sand); transform:translateY(-130%); transition:transform .25s ease; }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    .nav-links .btn{margin-top:6px;}
    .nav-toggle{display:block;}
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    padding:110px 0 90px; text-align:center; position:relative;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 20%, rgba(242,169,184,.18), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0%, rgba(27,107,103,.12), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cream) 0%, var(--cream-alt) 100%);
  }
  .hero-art{
    height:380px; border-radius:24px; margin:0 auto 46px; max-width:920px;
    background-image: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,);
    background-size:cover; background-position:center 68%;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(18,77,74,.22);
  }
  @media(max-width:820px){ .hero-art{ height:280px; } }
  .hero h1{font-size:2.7rem; max-width:780px; margin:0 auto 18px; color:var(--ink);}
  .hero p.lead{max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 34px; color:var(--ink); font-size:1.08rem;}
  .hero .cta-row{display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  /* ABOUT */
  .about{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; align-items:center;}
  .about-art{
    height:420px; border-radius:20px;
    background-image: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,);
    background-size:cover; background-position:center 62%;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  }
  .about-art::before{content:""; position:absolute; inset:18px; border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55); border-radius:12px;}
  .about h2{font-size:2.1rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .about p{margin-bottom:16px; color:var(--ink); opacity:.9;}
  .about .tag{display:inline-block; background:var(--teal); color:#fff; font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.12em; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:20px; margin-bottom:18px; font-weight:600;}

  @media(max-width:820px){ .about{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .about-art{height:260px; order:-1;} }

  /* OFFER CARDS */
  .offer{background:var(--cream-alt);}
  .section-head{text-align:center; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 56px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--grey);}
  .cards{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:28px;}
  .card{background:#fff; border-radius:18px; padding:38px 30px; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(43,43,43,.06); border:1px solid rgba(201,191,165,.35);}
  .card .icon{width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(27,107,103,.1); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .card h3{font-size:1.18rem; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .card p{color:var(--grey); font-size:.95rem;}
  @media(max-width:820px){ .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* HOW IT WORKS */
  .steps{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:30px; counter-reset:step; margin-top:10px;}
  .step{position:relative; padding:34px 26px 26px; background:#fff; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid rgba(201,191,165,.4);}
  .step .num{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--teal); color:#fff; font-weight:700;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px; font-size:.95rem;
  }
  .step h3{font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .step .price{color:var(--coral); font-weight:600; font-size:.9rem; margin-bottom:12px; display:block;}
  .step p{color:var(--grey); font-size:.92rem;}
  @media(max-width:820px){ .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* PROMISE BANNER */
  .promise{background:var(--teal); color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:80px 0;}
  .promise .script{color:#fff; font-size:2.4rem; display:block; line-height:1.35;}
  .promise p.small{margin-top:18px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size:.9rem; letter-spacing:.05em;}

  /* FOLLOW ALONG */
  .follow{background:var(--cream-alt);}
  .pillars{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:26px; margin-top:46px;}
  .pillar{background:#fff; border-radius:16px; padding:30px 26px; border:1px solid rgba(201,191,165,.4);}
  .pillar .tag2{font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--coral); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px; display:block;}
  .pillar h3{font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .pillar p{color:var(--grey); font-size:.9rem;}
  @media(max-width:820px){ .pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .follow-cta{text-align:center; margin-top:48px;}

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact{text-align:center;}
  .contact h2{font-size:2.1rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .contact p.lead{color:var(--grey); max-width:520px; margin:0 auto 38px;}
  .contact-row{display:flex; gap:18px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:26px;}
  .contact .note{color:var(--grey); font-size:.88rem; max-width:440px; margin:0 auto;}

  footer{background:var(--teal-dark); color:rgba(255,255,255,.75); padding:44px 0 30px; text-align:center; font-size:.85rem;}
  footer .pfc{font-family:var(--script); font-size:1.7rem; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px;}
  footer .pfc img{height:70px; width:auto; display:block; margin:0 auto;}
  footer a{color:#fff; opacity:.85;}
  footer a:hover{opacity:1;}
  footer .links{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:22px; margin:14px 0 18px;}

  .divider{
    height:44px; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10px 0, transparent 12px, var(--cream-alt) 13px) 0 -12px / 40px 24px repeat-x;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#top" class="brand">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="PFC — Phuket Family Concierge">
    </a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#offer">What We Offer</a>
      <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
      <a href="#follow">Follow Along</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Ciao, welcome to Phuket</span>
      <h1>Bespoke travel, planned around your family</h1>
      <p class="lead">Nine years of living in Phuket, four kids of my own, and a lot of trial and error — so your trip doesn't have to be. Tailor-made itineraries for families and couples, built around how you actually want to travel.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Planning Your Trip</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-outline">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Priscilla on a beach in Phuket"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <div>
        <span class="tag">Meet Priscilla</span>
        <h2>Ciao, I am Priscilla — an Italian mum living in Thailand for 9&nbsp;years.</h2>
        <p>I started PFC because I know how overwhelming it can be to plan the perfect family holiday — endless tabs, forum threads, and reviews that never quite tell you what you need to know.</p>
        <p>With four kids of my own, aged 2 to 13, I've tested more resorts, beaches, and "kid-friendly" claims than I can count — and I know just as well what makes a trip work for couples looking for quiet, romantic time away. Every PFC itinerary comes from what I'd genuinely choose for my own family, or for a night out with my husband.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-art" role="img" aria-label="Beach in Phuket"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="offer" class="offer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <p>Every plan is designed around your family — not a template pulled off a travel blog.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">🌺</div>
          <h3>Bespoke Itineraries</h3>
          <p>Designed around your family's style, life, and dreams — not a one-size-fits-all package.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">🗺️</div>
          <h3>Hidden Gems &amp; Local Secrets</h3>
          <p>The places we love — the ones you won't find by searching Google, only by living here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">💛</div>
          <h3>Couples Time Matters Too</h3>
          <p>Romantic dinners, private villas, and magical moments — PFC isn't only for families.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How a Bespoke Plan Works</h2>
        <p>Three simple steps, from your first message to a plan that's genuinely yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Tell Us About Your Trip</h3>
          <span class="price">Free</span>
          <p>A short enquiry — send us an email and we'll get back to you with our quick trip form covering your dates, who's travelling, and what matters most to you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>The Discovery Call</h3>
          <span class="price">Fee applies — details sent by email</span>
          <p>A 45-minute video call to go deeper, followed by a draft plan — a day-by-day structure, the type of stay and area for each part of your trip, and the experiences we'd build around it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Bringing It To Life</h3>
          <span class="price">Bespoke pricing</span>
          <p>Once you're ready to move forward, we finalise the exact hotels, villas, restaurants, and experiences — sharing direct contacts and booking details, and staying on call throughout your trip.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="promise">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="script">More time to enjoy.<br>Less time worrying.<br>Memories that last a lifetime.</span>
      <p class="small">OUR PROMISE TO YOU</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="follow" class="follow">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Follow Along on Instagram</h2>
        <p>Real reviews, real family (and couple) trips, before you ever plan your own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag2">FAMILY &amp; COUPLE CHECK</span>
          <h3>Honest reviews, real ratings</h3>
          <p>A rated verdict on the hotels, beach clubs, and restaurants we actually visit — for families and for couples.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag2">IS IT WORTH IT?</span>
          <h3>Straight answers before you go</h3>
          <p>Is that beach worth the trek? That beach club worth the price? We tell you honestly, before you book.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag2">COME WITH ME</span>
          <h3>A day in the life in Phuket</h3>
          <p>Fish markets, rainy-season beach days, date nights — the everyday moments behind the highlight reel.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="follow-cta">
        <a href="https://instagram.com/PLACEHOLDER_HANDLE" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow @PLACEHOLDER_HANDLE on Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ready to start planning?</h2>
      <p class="lead">Send us a short email about your trip, and we'll reply within 48 hours with our quick enquiry form to get things moving.</p>
      <div class="contact-row">
        <a href="mailto:hello@PLACEHOLDER-domain.com" class="btn btn-primary">Email Us</a>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Based in Phuket, Thailand — replying personally to every enquiry.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pfc"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="PFC — Phuket Family Concierge"></div>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://instagram.com/PLACEHOLDER_HANDLE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@PLACEHOLDER-domain.com">Email</a>
    </div>
    <div>© 2026 PFC — Phuket Family Concierge · Phuket, Thailand</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  const toggle = document.getElementById('navToggle');
  const links = document.getElementById('navLinks');
  toggle.addEventListener('click', () => links.classList.toggle('open'));
  links.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => links.classList.remove('open')));
</script>

</body>
</html>
